1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,940
Meet Robo-Cleo.
Faster. Cheaper. Obedient.

2
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,520
Cheaper than free?

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,859
Robo-Cleo. Press.

4
00:00:09,805 --> 00:00:12,914
Now press nothing
until I say so.

5
00:00:13,145 --> 00:00:14,234
Pressing.

6
00:00:15,058 --> 00:00:17,518
Stop! Stop pressing things!

7
00:00:17,558 --> 00:00:18,738
Pressing things.

8
00:00:18,778 --> 00:00:20,698
Cleo, do something!

9
00:00:20,738 --> 00:00:24,558
Robo-Cleo.
Do not press your off switch.

10
00:00:24,598 --> 00:00:25,854
Pressing.

11
00:00:27,338 --> 00:00:29,958
It's me.
But faster.

12
00:00:29,998 --> 00:00:31,138
Double pay.

13
00:00:31,178 --> 00:00:34,024
Double zero is still zero.

14
00:00:34,438 --> 00:00:36,938
Triple! Triple zero!

15
00:00:36,978 --> 00:00:38,438
Deal.
